.TH OWASP-A04 7 "2026-11-15" "OWASP Top 10:2025" "Software Weakness Reference"
.SH NAME
owasp\-a04 \- Cryptographic Failures (OWASP Top 10:2025 A04)
.SH RANK
OWASP Top 10:2025 rank \fB#4\fR (A02:2021).
.SH DESCRIPTION
Secrets in transit or at rest are weakly protected: old ciphers, hard\-coded keys, missing TLS, homemade crypto. Often leads to data exposure or full compromise.
.PP
This page is an overlay. Vulnerable\->fixed code lives on the \fBcwe\-*\fR(7) pages listed below, not here.
